WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:10.875
Polly woke up late today.

2
00:00:10.876 --> 00:00:19.166
I think she missed breakfast!

3
00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.606
Jack: You're running fast, Polly.

4
00:00:21.607 --> 00:00:24.099
Where are you going? Polly:

5
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.401
To breakfast. I'm hungry! Jack:

6
00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:29.269
Me too!

7
00:00:29.270 --> 00:00:31.986
Polly: Did you wake up late too?

8
00:00:31.987 --> 00:00:41.145
Jack: No. I got stuck in my burrow.

9
00:00:41.146 --> 00:00:42.983
Polly: Let's hurry to the barn.

10
00:00:42.984 --> 00:00:53.684
We don't want to miss the meal. Gary:

11
00:00:53.685 --> 00:00:58.220
There you two are. Jack:

12
00:00:58.221 --> 00:01:00.808
Where is everyone? Polly:

13
00:01:00.809 --> 00:01:03.713
And where is breakfast? Gary:

14
00:01:03.714 --> 00:01:12.578
It's over. The food is gone. Polly:

15
00:01:12.579 --> 00:01:14.700
But we're hungry!

16
00:01:14.701 --> 00:01:24.795
Gary: Oh well. Next time, be on time.

17
00:01:24.796 --> 00:01:30.692
Minnie: Polly and Jack! We missed you at breakfast.

18
00:01:30.693 --> 00:01:37.213
Gary: I told them they missed it.

19
00:01:37.214 --> 00:01:40.268
Polly: We're hungry, Minnie.

20
00:01:40.269 --> 00:01:46.364
Minnie: I'm sure you are. But Gary is right.

21
00:01:46.365 --> 00:01:52.467
There's no more food left. Polly:

22
00:01:52.468 --> 00:01:55.227
When is lunch? Minnie:

23
00:01:55.228 --> 00:02:02.856
At noon. Polly:

24
00:02:02.857 --> 00:02:05.966
What will we do until then?

25
00:02:05.967 --> 00:02:09.026
Minnie: Why don't you go see Omar?

26
00:02:09.027 --> 00:02:12.740
Polly: Maybe Omar has some food.

27
00:02:12.741 --> 00:02:23.953
Jack: I hope so. Let's go and find out!

